- Python 3.x
- tkinter (stdlib - native Windows GUI)
- ctypes (Windows API: user32.dll, winmm.dll, kernel32.dll)
- threading (async listener + keyboard hook)
- queue.Queue (action dispatch from hook threads to main thread)
- json (profile storage)
- os (file path)
- time (delays)
- atexit (cleanup)

Architecture:
  engine/   — pure Windows API (no tkinter, no GUI concern)
  app/      — tkinter UI layer (imports engine, never reverse)

